{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"executive-title","type":"text","x":0,"y":-620,"width":7400,"height":250,"text":"# PPJ SOFTWARE DELIVERY EXECUTIVE CONTROL\n\nBACKLOG -> KICK-OFF -> ANALYSIS -> DESIGN -> DEVELOPMENT -> UAT / PRE-GO-LIVE -> GO-LIVE / PRODUCTION / SUPPORT -> CLOSED\n\nDrag a registered project card between the eight lane groups, save Canvas, then run the Canvas state sync. Registry becomes persisted source of truth after synchronization.\n\nSnapshot: [[03_Projects/_Registry/PPJ_PORTFOLIO_CURRENT_SNAPSHOT|Current Portfolio Snapshot]] | Last verified: 2026-08-24"},
		{"id":"executive-reading-guide","type":"text","x":0,"y":-340,"width":7400,"height":180,"text":"## Control rules\n\nDelivery Stage = card geometry in the eight pipeline groups. Lifecycle, Status, Progress, Current Gate, Priority and Primary Domain remain separate. ON HOLD / BLOCKED / WAITING are status overlays, never replacement stages. Candidate initiatives stay outside the pipeline until registered. CLOSED requires approved closure."},
		{"id":"lane-0","type":"group","x":0,"y":0,"width":760,"height":620,"label":"BACKLOG","color":"6"},
		{"id":"lane-guide-0","type":"text","x":30,"y":65,"width":700,"height":95,"text":"Approved project not yet scheduled for kick-off."},
		{"id":"lane-empty-0","type":"text","x":30,"y":185,"width":700,"height":120,"text":"No current registered project in this stage. The stage remains permanently visible."},
		{"id":"lane-1","type":"group","x":830,"y":0,"width":760,"height":620,"label":"KICK-OFF","color":"5"},
		{"id":"lane-guide-1","type":"text","x":860,"y":65,"width":700,"height":95,"text":"Owner, users, problem, scope and success outcome are being aligned."},
		{"id":"lane-empty-1","type":"text","x":860,"y":185,"width":700,"height":120,"text":"No current registered project in this stage. The stage remains permanently visible."},
		{"id":"lane-2","type":"group","x":1660,"y":0,"width":760,"height":3420,"label":"ANALYSIS","color":"3"},
		{"id":"lane-guide-2","type":"text","x":1690,"y":65,"width":700,"height":95,"text":"Process, rules, data, risks and decisions are being clarified."},
		{"id":"ppj-project-8f9208b9d2cfda92","type":"text","x":1690,"y":185,"width":700,"height":290,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:FIN.AI.FINANCE.MANAGEMENT.v1.2 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/FIN.AI.FINANCE.MANAGEMENT.v1.1|FIN.AI.FINANCE.MANAGEMENT.v1.2]]\n\nDomain: Finance / Accounting\nDelivery Stage: ANALYSIS\nLifecycle: Strategic Active\nStatus: Active\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: P1\nGate: WS2 Rule Catalogue and Databricks access; then WS3 source discovery\n\nOutcome\n- Centralized Finance Control Platform for completeness, correct OC/period, actual versus plan, missing cost, profitability, drill-down and exception ownership.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/FIN.AI.FINANCE.MANAGEMENT.v1.1/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]"},
		{"id":"ppj-project-979f588e2fcfa0dc","type":"text","x":1690,"y":505,"width":700,"height":290,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:Admin Expense Management.v1.1 -->\n\n## [[07_Decision_Log/DEC-20260824-ADMIN-EXPENSE-DOMAIN|Admin Expense Management.v1.1]]\n\nDomain: Needs Domain Governance Decision\nDelivery Stage: ANALYSIS\nLifecycle: Workflow Demo Completed / Requirement Refinement\nStatus: Active\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: P6\nGate: Expand demonstrated travel request into end-to-end expense and settlement requirements\n\nOutcome\n- Standardize Administration business-travel and expense-management workflows.\n\nBoard\n- Needs Confirmation"},
		{"id":"ppj-project-80875b71393480f3","type":"text","x":1690,"y":825,"width":700,"height":290,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:MER.MARKET.INTELLIGENCE.v1.1 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/E-commerce Market Intelligence v.2.3|MER.MARKET.INTELLIGENCE.v1.1]]\n\nDomain: Merchandising\nDelivery Stage: ANALYSIS\nLifecycle: Active Intelligence\nStatus: Active\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: Medium\nGate: Commercial intelligence delivery\n\nOutcome\n- Create commercial intelligence from external market data and PPJ internal capability.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/E-commerce Market Intelligence v.2.3/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]"},
		{"id":"ppj-project-780d8fc4ae5bb612","type":"text","x":1690,"y":1145,"width":700,"height":290,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:PPJ.UIT.ACADEMIC.COLLABORATION.v1.1 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ.UIT.ACADEMIC.COLLABORATION.v1.1|PPJ.UIT.ACADEMIC.COLLABORATION.v1.1]]\n\nDomain: External Collaboration\nDelivery Stage: ANALYSIS\nLifecycle: Active / Problem Framing\nStatus: External Collaboration\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: Medium\nGate: Academic problem package\n\nOutcome\n- Frame Fabric Waste Optimization / 2D Pattern Nesting for academic collaboration.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/PPJ.UIT.ACADEMIC.COLLABORATION.v1.1/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]"},
		{"id":"ppj-project-3c26130a6739dc45","type":"text","x":1690,"y":1465,"width":700,"height":290,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:PPJxNUNOX.ScanTrial -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PPJxNUNOX|PPJxNUNOX.ScanTrial]]\n\nDomain: Fabric / Textiles Technique\nDelivery Stage: ANALYSIS\nLifecycle: Partnership / Digital Library Evaluation\nStatus: Evaluation\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: Decision\nGate: Working-session outcome unconfirmed\n\nOutcome\n- Evaluate fabric scanning and Fabric/Garment Digital Library potential.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/PPJxNUNOX/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]"},
		{"id":"ppj-project-0b0545a4c4de9930","type":"text","x":1690,"y":1785,"width":700,"height":290,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:PPJxQSee.AI -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PPJxQSee.ai|PPJxQSee.AI]]\n\nDomain: QC / TQM\nDelivery Stage: ANALYSIS\nLifecycle: On Hold\nStatus: On Hold\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: Hold\nGate: Reactivation decision\n\nOutcome\n- Preserve the QC AI inspection opportunity until ownership, resources, data, metrics and budget exist.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/PPJxQSee.ai/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]"},
