		{"id":"ppj-project-bc75f5342844e3e8","type":"text","x":1690,"y":3065,"width":700,"height":290,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:QC.Primo1D.RFID.Thread.v1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ XPrimo1D RFID Thread|QC.Primo1D.RFID.Thread.v1.0]]\n\nDomain: QC / TQM\nDelivery Stage: ANALYSIS\nLifecycle: Business Case / Pre-PoC\nStatus: Pending Decision\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: Decision\nGate: Business/customer case decision\n\nOutcome\n- Evaluate RFID thread only when QC need, MER commercial case, customer willingness to pay and factory feasibility align.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/PPJ XPrimo1D RFID Thread/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]"},
