		{"id":"ppj-project-56ad3c7dd45eb61e","type":"text","x":2520,"y":185,"width":700,"height":290,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:PUR.GDI.Automation.v1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PUR.GDI Automation|PUR.GDI.Automation.v1.0]]\n\nDomain: Sourcing / Purchasing\nDelivery Stage: DESIGN\nLifecycle: Active / WFX API Integration\nStatus: Active\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: P3\nGate: WFX API contract discovery and controlled integration design\n\nOutcome\n- Automate GDI creation/update while preserving WFX transaction control, validation, confirmation and audit.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/PUR.GDI Automation/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]"},
		{"id":"ppj-project-50ea50646c9201cf","type":"text","x":2520,"y":505,"width":700,"height":290,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:WASH.SAMPLING.MANAGEMENT.PORTAL.v1.1 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/WASH.SAMPLING.MANAGEMENT.PORTAL.v1.1|WASH.SAMPLING.MANAGEMENT.PORTAL.v1.1]]\n\nDomain: Production + Wash\nDelivery Stage: DESIGN\nLifecycle: Analysis / Product Design\nStatus: Active\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: Medium\nGate: Sampling workflow and product design\n\nOutcome\n- Create a PPJ Group Portal workflow for Wash sample requests, trials, results, approvals and history.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/WASH.SAMPLING.MANAGEMENT.PORTAL.v1.1/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]"},
