		{"id":"ppj-project-c542a373bdb1dbc0","type":"text","x":3350,"y":185,"width":700,"height":290,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:COSTING.AGENTIC.PLATFORM.v1.1 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ.COSTING.AGENT.PLATFORM.v1.1|COSTING.AGENTIC.PLATFORM.v1.1]]\n\nDomain: Merchandising\nDelivery Stage: DEVELOPMENT\nLifecycle: Active Development\nStatus: Active\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: P2\nGate: Sew v1.2 and Wash Agent development\n\nOutcome\n- Generate a Costing / Quotation Package for Merchandising review and customer quotation.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/PPJ.COSTING.AGENT.PLATFORM.v1.1/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]"},
		{"id":"ppj-project-776c7077a447dac7","type":"text","x":3350,"y":505,"width":700,"height":290,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:PROD.IOT.CHuyenTreo.v1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PROD.IOT.CHuyenTreo_1|PROD.IOT.CHuyenTreo.v1.0]]\n\nDomain: Production + Wash\nDelivery Stage: DEVELOPMENT\nLifecycle: Development\nStatus: Active\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: Medium\nGate: Source and KPI reconciliation\n\nOutcome\n- Provide production-line visibility for output, target vs actual, efficiency, downtime, WIP, line status, hourly production and trends.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/PROD.IOT.CHuyenTreo_1/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]"},
