		{"id":"ppj-project-73f3193ae1c9e661","type":"text","x":4180,"y":825,"width":700,"height":290,"text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:PUR.Material.Allocation.v1.1 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PUR.Material.Allocation.v1.2|PUR.Material.Allocation.v1.1]]\n\nDomain: Sourcing / Purchasing\nDelivery Stage: UAT / PRE-GO-LIVE\nLifecycle: First Flow Validated\nStatus: Active\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: P7\nGate: Exception, rollback and transaction-safety testing\n\nOutcome\n- Validate controlled reallocation of surplus NPL across eligible OCs.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/PUR.Material.Allocation.v1.2/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]"},
